WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:16.540
So then Major General Karen opposes
what the New Himukan government's doing?

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.830
No.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.420
It's finally here.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.180
There's more than meets the eye.
Karen most surely has...

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:39.940
"Warning!"

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.140
...another motive.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.540
Chief Sumeragi!

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.420
A large number of Others have
advanced into the heart of Suoh!

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.830
What?!

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.790
Exterminate them at once!

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:09.170
But the defense system is inoperable!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.090
Psynet is down!

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.220
And the council?

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.640
I don't know!
There's no way to contact them.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:21.520
Don't tell me Arahabaki has been...

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.700
Karen, why would you do this?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:48.170
I <i>will </i>get it back this time.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.820
Yuito!

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.570
Yuito? Yuito!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.030
Yuito!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:25.170
What's the matter? Focus!

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.630
R-Right.

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:29.040
Wataru, do you read me?

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.670
What's happening?

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.740
Wataru?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.080
It's no use. He's not responding.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.500
Psynet is down.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.870
Yuito, be careful out there!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:06.960
Wataru?!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:10.880
Arahabaki, the computer system
that controls all of Suoh, shut down.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.710
It's a state of emergency.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:17.430
The cause is unknown, but it's
taken down our defense system.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.640
And that let the Others
penetrate into the city.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.810
Wait, Wataru. I don't understand.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.980
I'm communicating via one-way telepathy.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.940
I'll see whether I can get
Psynet back online.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.270
Haruka is out in the field, so--

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.320
What the--?

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.960
The Seiran Regional Force?
HQ is surrounded!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.960
What are you doing?!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.000
Wataru?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.420
Yuito, eliminate as many
of the Others as possible.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.090
We'll get through this!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.100
It appears to be a coup d'etat.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.310
Wataru? Wataru?!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.270
Huh? What's going on?

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.560
He contacted me via telepathy.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.400
He said Arahabaki shut down,

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.820
and Psynet and the defense
system aren't functioning.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.860
And there's been a coup.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.030
A coup?!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:20.910
Is this Major General Karen's doing?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.960
To think he'd go this far.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.500
Yuito, if Major General Karen means
to overthrow the government...

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.470
My dad!

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.400
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.700
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.610
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.030
<i>And disappears</i>

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.120
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.660
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.750
<i>I get sick</i>

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.670
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.080
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:17.050
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:21.930
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.760
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.850
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:31.600
<i>I know why</i>

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.190
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.820
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.280
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:46.120
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.700
<i>We will fly</i>

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.540
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:55.380
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.800
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:14.430
Karen's Revolt

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.270
There's more.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.850
I got this!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.200
Yuito!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:37.250
Shouldn't you go check on your dad--
I mean, Chairman Sumeragi?

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.970
Yuito.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:46.720
I thought he'd be worried
about Chief Sumeragi.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:49.930
I believe he seeks to fulfill his duty.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.690
What is all this?

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.700
What do you mean we lost contact?

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.290
Our comms are jammed.
We can't reach any of our forces.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.370
Who's behind this?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.040
Comms link established.
Initiating video display.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.170
This is via a traffic camera
right before the jamming began.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.760
It's the Seiran Regional Force!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:41.230
Excuse me, Chief Sumeragi.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.280
Psynet's backup system
and all radio comms are down.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:49.280
As you're aware, the Seiran
Regional Force has us surrounded.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.870
As for the underground
emergency evacuation route...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.870
The enemy most likely knows of it.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.920
And the OSF is split in two.

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.330
What of the council?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.960
We're still unable
to assess the situation,

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.460
including the chairman's whereabouts.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.540
What the hell?! A coup?!
By Major General Karen?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:46.550
Annihilating an Other with a single blow
is none other than Septentrion First Class

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:50.130
"Brain Eater" Major General Karen Travers!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.140
He's so cool!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.800
Yeah.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:59.180
However, our nation faces
the ever-present threat of the Others.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:03.400
Both the scouted class with
their outstanding innate psionics,

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:07.690
and the volunteer faction with psionics
forged through training,

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.900
are equally vital.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.360
The power within each of your brains
must be combined...

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:15.620
Private First Class Yuito Sumeragi.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.950
Sir?

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.370
Major General Karen!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:25.130
Word is you've already
been hounded by the Crows.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:26.840
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:29.550
Use the mass media to your advantage.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:33.430
You'll gain rank faster if you
get your name out there.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:36.350
And serving on Seto Platoon
will whip you into shape.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.640
See that you give it your all.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.390
I've got high hopes for you.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.150
Thank you!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.860
Isn't that great, Yuito?

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.150
I heard Major General Karen
saw great potential in you

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.440
ever since you were in training.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.450
What? Really?

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:57.030
Yes, you have a Septentrion First Class
with high hopes for you.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.450
Do us proud.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.830
Yes, sir!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.380
Is Nagi's sudden change

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:10.010
also somehow linked to
the New Himukan government?

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:14.430
Why would Major General Karen
take things so far?

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:18.010
I bet Dad knows something.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.020
Ugh, there's no end to them.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.400
What's wrong?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.870
Major General Fubuki is coming.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.530
Straight ahead.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.790
Which platoon do you serve on?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.250
Oh, um, at the moment--

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:54.090
Commander Seto was killed in action, so...

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.220
Seto was killed in action?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.510
Hold on! Are you under
Major General Karen's command?!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.220
N-No!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.980
Major General Fubuki, allow me to explain.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.150
I see.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:14.700
So the other platoon members
besides Gemma weren't called to action.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.070
No, sir.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:20.700
And the fact that Gemma has
joined up with your platoon

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.040
means he's not on Karen's side.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.500
Is that an accurate assessment?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.170
Yes, it is.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.540
Got it.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.880
I need more allies. Each one counts.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.960
From this moment, you're in my unit.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.300
Yes, sir.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.430
Even I lack a firm grasp of the situation.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.220
All that's certain is
the Seiran Regional Force

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:46.730
and other elements have
conspired to attack Suoh.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.020
And Karen is behind it.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.070
He put innocent civilians in harm's way.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:57.610
We're evacuating civilians
who couldn't flee in time.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:01.870
But I need you people for something else.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:06.040
I want you to check that the chairman
and council members are safe.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.380
The chairman and several
council members evacuated late,

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:14.050
and are now heading to a shelter.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:19.550
The OSF and NDF were already sent
after them, but we've lost contact.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.600
The chairman will be relieved to see you.

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:24.890
Understood.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.180
Proceed with caution.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.310
Not all OSF members are on your side.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.280
The Seiran Regional Force
has yet to make a move.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.200
Are they trying to buy time?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.950
I don't know.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.870
Is it to keep us from making a move?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.960
What are you trying to do, Karen?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.630
Karen.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.560
It's just awful what happened.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:13.060
To think the city would change like this.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:19.030
Those who don't have psionic power
always see the world like this.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:22.780
That's because duds
aren't connected to Psynet.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.080
Luka!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.910
Where is Karen?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.960
No leads yet.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:36.130
My brother's whereabouts and
objectives are still unknown.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:40.050
There's no news about Kagero,
Kyoka, and her platoon, either.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.110
Kasane!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.200
Huh? Are we back online?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.620
No, this is...

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.710
Major General Karen!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:16.210
Karen!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:21.130
People of New Himuka with your eyes shut

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:25.970
and all you fools who choose
to look the other way...

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.600
I am Karen Travers.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:31.600
I reject New Himuka's
surveillance society.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.940
My eyes are opened wide.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.410
Hmm? Did they fix it?

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.870
It's Major General Karen.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:51.950
People of New Himuka with your eyes shut

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:56.830
and all you fools who choose
to look the other way...

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.960
Huh?

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.130
I am Karen Travers.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.590
I reject New Himuka's
surveillance society.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:05.130
My eyes are opened wide.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:09.220
My comrades and I are resolved
to walk hand in hand with Seiran,

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.430
which is of the same mind.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.140
Sad people of New Himuka,

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.940
do not avert your eyes from the truth.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:20.650
This nation has gone mad.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:25.900
The New Himukan government
has used Psynet to advance society.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:33.080
As you know, at the heart of Psynet
is the city computer Arahabaki.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.710
Nearly every citizen possesses
some psionic power,

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:41.590
and their brains are connected
to each other via this system.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:46.880
This enables you to access all manner
of information wherever you are,

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:51.810
offering you lives of comfort
and convenience.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.890
But that is not true freedom.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.770
Why's he doing this?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:59.900
All information is controlled
by the government,

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.110
and the people are being rendered docile.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.150
Face the facts.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:12.330
We are all livestock used and exploited
for the sake of the government and nation.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:15.000
All who disturb the order are eliminated,

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.870
driven insane, or willingly
made into pawns.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:23.380
A New Himuka that only raises people
like livestock is an injustice!

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:28.760
Now is the time to rise up and overthrow
the New Himukan government!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:30.050
But...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.550
They're coming!

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:41.480
Yuito, head to the shelter where
Chairman Sumeragi should be!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.820
Leave this to us!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.450
Now, go!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.540
Open your eyes, people of New Himuka.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.300
Seiran protects the free will
of the people

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:11.260
and offers an environment in which people
can truly live like human beings.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:15.430
And I promise to protect that.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:19.350
All who are of a like mind
are free to join us.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.240
Are you okay?!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:36.990
Yeah, but there are still
more Others over that way.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:42.080
The shelter where the chairman
is headed is that way, too!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.330
Dad!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.920
I've made up my mind!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:50.090
I'm joining the OSF--
no matter what you say!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:57.430
That's impossible for someone
with a low psionic aptitude like you.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:01.270
Look how old you are,
and you still haven't been scouted.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:05.150
It doesn't matter!
I can always volunteer and train!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:07.520
I'll show you I can do it!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.820
What about your mother?

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.740
What would she say
if she were still alive?

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.960
Do you think she'd be happy?

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:38.510
Whatever the government is up to,
my dad is still my dad.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.980
Congratulations on your induction.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:45.850
I was against you joining the OSF, but...

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.520
Just see that you don't get hurt.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:53.360
Now that you've joined the force,
you can truly call yourself a man.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.120
As such, I want to tell you
about our family

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:59.080
and your dearly departed mother.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:03.370
I'll have Kaito over,
and we can all have dinner together.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.960
I'll be in touch.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.340
Standing on the front lines of Seiran,

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.500
I've raised a rebel standard against

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.630
a surveillance society
benefiting a small few.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.590
I now consider Seiran as my home.

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.930
I <i>will </i>bring down the New Himukan regime!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:31.280
It is time to free ourselves
from the yoke of suppression.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.750
This is a war of revolution.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:51.880
If you have already opened
your eyes or you wish to...

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:53.420
Over here!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.340
...I await you!
Join me here in Seiran!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.970
Together we shall crush
the New Himukan regime!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:08.100
Get to safety! Now!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.740
W-Wait!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.460
Wh-What the--?

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.650
Who are you?

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.460
K--

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.750
Kasane?

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.630
What are you doing here?

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:06.260
Dad?

00:24:09.170 --> 00:24:11.930
A Doomed Tomorrow
